---
---
<section class="sec" id="build"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="tl-head"><span class="eyebrow">Seven days</span><h2>Watch it build, <em>day by day.</em></h2><p>From a long CV to a live executive site. Scroll to follow each step.</p></div>
  <div class="tl" id="tl">
    <div class="tl-line" aria-hidden="true"><div class="tl-progress"></div></div>
    <div class="tl-item left">
      <div class="tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="tl-card">
        <span class="tl-badge">Day 0</span>
        <h3>The Audit &amp; Extraction</h3>
        <p>We read your CV and find the results buried in it: the numbers, the scale and the wins that show leadership.</p>
        <div class="micro"><div><span>Before</span>&ldquo;Responsible for managing the sales team and increasing regional revenue.&rdquo;</div><div class="after"><span>After</span>&ldquo;Grew sales 62% in six years, leading a 120-person team.&rdquo;</div></div>
        <dl class="tl-sg"><div><dt>You send</dt><dd>Your current CV</dd></div><div><dt>You get</dt><dd>A free audit with your strongest results marked</dd></div></dl>
        <div class="tl-prev" role="img" aria-label="A sample CV with three key results highlighted"><div class="tl-scale"><div class="pv pv-cv on" data-pv="0" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="cvpg">Your CV · 4 pages</span><span class="cvaudit">Audit: 6 key results found</span>
              <div class="cvh">Your Name</div><div class="cvsub">Head of Sales · Dhaka · email@example.com · +880 1XXX-XXXXXX</div>
              <div class="cvs">Career Summary:</div>
              <p class="cvp">A sales and business development professional with over 15 years of experience across distribution, export and key accounts. Responsible for achieving targets, managing field teams and handling relationships with distributors and corporate clients&hellip;</p>
              <div class="cvs">Key Proficiencies:</div>
              <div class="cvcols"><span>Strategic problem solving</span><span>Team development</span><span>Channel management</span><span>Negotiation</span></div>
              <div class="cvs">Major Accomplishments:</div>
              <div class="cvk"><i>1</i><span>Grew overall sales by 62% over six years</span></div>
              <p class="cvp">Responsible for appointing distributors, preparing sales reports and coordinating with the finance and branding teams&hellip;</p>
              <div class="cvk"><i>2</i><span>Tripled export sales within one year</span></div>
              <div class="cvk"><i>3</i><span>Recovered 80% of overdue corporate dues within 12 months</span></div>
            </div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-item right">
      <div class="tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="tl-card">
        <span class="tl-badge">Days 1–2</span>
        <h3>The Narrative Rewrite</h3>
        <p>We shift the tone from a task list to a leadership story: a headline, the numbers that prove it, and a timeline of your roles.</p>
        
        <dl class="tl-sg"><div><dt>You send</dt><dd>A recent photo, your confirmation and the advance payment</dd></div><div><dt>You get</dt><dd>Your headline, key numbers and site plan</dd></div></dl>
        <div class="tl-prev" role="img" aria-label="A sample headline with four chosen numbers"><div class="tl-scale"><div class="pv pv-dark" data-pv="1" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="ps-label">Your headline</div>
              <div class="ps-head">Senior sales leader: distribution, export and key accounts.</div>
              <div class="ps-sub">Turning channel networks into steady, measurable growth.</div>
              <div class="ps-label">Numbers chosen from your CV</div>
              <div class="ps-tiles">
                <div><b>15+</b><span>Years in sales</span><em>From your summary</em></div>
                <div><b>62%</b><span>Sales growth, 6 years</span><em>From your achievements</em></div>
                <div><b>3x</b><span>Export growth, 1 year</span><em>From your achievements</em></div>
                <div><b>120</b><span>Sales team led</span><em>From your experience</em></div>
              </div>
            </div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-item left">
      <div class="tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="tl-card">
        <span class="tl-badge">Days 3–5</span>
        <h3>The Digital Build</h3>
        <p>Your story becomes a fast website, built for phones first, with one-tap PDF CV, LinkedIn, WhatsApp and email.</p>
        
        <dl class="tl-sg"><div><dt>You send</dt><dd>Nothing, unless we have a question</dd></div><div><dt>You get</dt><dd>A draft of your site to open on your phone</dd></div></dl>
        <div class="tl-prev" role="img" aria-label="A sample site on desktop and on a phone"><div class="tl-scale"><div class="pv pv-dark pv-phone" data-pv="5" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="ph-desk"><span class="ph-tag">Desktop</span><div class="ph-nav"></div><b>Your Name</b><small>Senior Sales Leader</small><div class="ph-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div>
              <div class="ph-mob"><span class="ph-tag">Phone</span><div class="ph-screen"><b>Your Name</b><small>Head of Sales · Dhaka</small><div class="ph-stats"><i></i><i></i></div><span class="g">Download CV</span><span>LinkedIn</span><span>WhatsApp</span><span>Email</span></div></div>
              <div class="ph-note">One-tap links, built for phones first</div>
            </div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-item right">
      <div class="tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="tl-card">
        <span class="tl-badge">Days 6–7</span>
        <h3>Review &amp; Live Launch</h3>
        <p>You review the draft, we refine it, and your executive portfolio goes live with a link you can share anywhere.</p>
        
        <dl class="tl-sg"><div><dt>You send</dt><dd>Your feedback and your go-ahead</dd></div><div><dt>You get</dt><dd>Your live executive website</dd></div></dl>
        <div class="tl-prev" role="img" aria-label="A sample site that is live"><div class="tl-scale"><div class="pv pv-dark pv-launch" data-pv="7" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="ln-live"><span class="ln-dot"></span><b>Your site is live</b><small>yourname</small></div>
              <div class="ps-label">Ready before launch</div>
              <div class="ln-checks"><span>PDF CV attached</span><span>LinkedIn, WhatsApp and email links tested</span><span>Phone view checked</span></div>
              <div class="ps-label">Share your link</div>
              <div class="ps-chips"><span>LinkedIn</span><span>Email signature</span><span>Your CV</span><span>WhatsApp</span></div>
            </div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-item right">
      <div class="tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <figure class="tl-card tl-reaction">
        <span class="tl-badge">Client reaction</span>
        <a class="tl-postlink" href="https://lnkd.in/p/gvmHMNrG" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open the LinkedIn post in a new tab"><img src="/sites/linkedin-reaction.webp" width="429" height="473" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="LinkedIn post by Muhammed Mehdi Hasan Chowdhury, Head of Sales at BSRM Steels Ltd., unveiling his digital portfolio. He thanks Sadman Rayan Shuvo, Founder of Portfolio Studio, for designing and building the website and says his strategic eye for executive branding made the process seamless from concept to launch." /></a>
        <figcaption>Posted on LinkedIn by Muhammed Mehdi Hasan Chowdhury. <a href="https://lnkd.in/p/gvmHMNrG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View the post ↗</a></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="tl-note">The previews use sample content. Your site uses your own facts and numbers. The client reaction is a real LinkedIn post.</p>
</div></section>

<script>
  import '../scripts/timeline.js';
</script>
